<figure class="runoff-calendar" id="runoff-calendar">
  <p class="runoff-calendar-label">Chart</p>
  <p class="runoff-calendar-title">Runoff calendar</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Thu, Nov. 12</strong> Last day to register if a city runoff is held.</li>
    <li><strong>Tue, Nov. 17</strong> Canvass scheduled for 11 a.m. It may occur earlier. Council orders any necessary runoff the same day.</li>
    <li><strong>Sat, Dec. 12</strong> Election day only if a runoff is ordered. Early voting by personal appearance would run Nov. 30 through Dec. 8.</li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>Weekday names are added by the Bulletin from the 2026 calendar. The city schedule lists the dates and says the canvass may occur earlier. Graphic: The Austin Bulletin. <a href="https://services.austintexas.gov/edims/document.cfm?id=472487">City of Austin runoff election calendar</a></figcaption>
